## What to deliver

Build the raider sprite sheet up operation by operation until each
`frames/<index>.png` matches the brief: a lean, mandible-less forager drawn in
neutral grey, animated as a four-step walk cycle in each facing — empty in
frames 0–15 and visibly laden with a gold seed, reading slow and heavy, in
frames 16–31. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded per-frame action logs
are your finished submission.
